<title>USA: CheckFree in processing deal with Schwab.</title>
<headline>CheckFree in processing deal with Schwab.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>CheckFree Corp said Wednesday it agreed to provide bill payment processing for the customers of Charles Schwab &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>The terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Schwab, the financial services firm, said it will allow its customers to pay bills through its Web site or by touch-tone telephone while CheckFree will offer the bill payment services and technical support.</p>
</text>
